vairāgyeṇa ca gṛhyate\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":1986,\"bb\":1757,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/6/35/b1757/\",\"shadow_value\":\"śrī-bhagavān uvāca – the Personality of Godhead said; asaṁśayam – undoubtedly; mahā-bāho – O mighty-armed one; manaḥ – the mind; durnigraham – difficult to curb; calam – flickering; abhyāsena – by practice; tu – but; kaunteya – O son of Kuntī; vairāgyeṇa – by detachment; ca – also; gṛhyate – can be so controlled.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"śrī-bhagavān uvāca\",\"translation\":\"the Personality of Godhead said\"},{\"word\":\"asaṁśayam\",\"translation\":\"undoubtedly\"},{\"word\":\"mahā-bāho\",\"translation\":\"O mighty-armed one\"},{\"word\":\"manaḥ\",\"translation\":\"the mind\"},{\"word\":\"durnigraham\",\"translation\":\"difficult to curb\"},{\"word\":\"calam\",\"translation\":\"flickering\"},{\"word\":\"abhyāsena\",\"translation\":\"by practice\"},{\"word\":\"tu\",\"translation\":\"but\"},{\"word\":\"kaunteya\",\"translation\":\"O son of Kuntī\"},{\"word\":\"vairāgyeṇa\",\"translation\":\"by detachment\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"gṛhyate\",\"translation\":\"can be so controlled\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":1987,\"bb\":1758,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/6/35/b1758/\",\"body_value\":\"Lord Śrī Kṛṣṇa said: O mighty-armed son of Kuntī, it is undoubtedly very difficult to curb the restless mind, but it is possible by suitable practice and by detachment.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1988,\"bb\":1759,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/6/35/b1759/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 6.35\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 6.3